    + "// range and, when it runs out, grows a fresh level at the *left* (the old root\n"
    + "// dropped into a non-zero child slot), rebasing `origin`/`capacity` by that\n"
    + "// level's span — so a non-zero `origin` can leave the tree's left edge only\n"
    + "// partially populated. Every lookup addresses by `index + origin`, which is what\n"
    + "// lets both ends stay amortized O(1) over one shared trie.\n"
